        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer various services to support theatrical and television production for cinema, broadcast, and home entertainment, including equipment training and maintenance, mixing room alignment, equalization, as well as audio, color, and light image calibration.",
        "start_character": 21759,
        "end_character": 22029
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide PCS for products sold and equipment installed at Dolby Cinema theaters operated by exhibitor partners, and we support the implementation of our technologies into products manufactured by our licensees.",
        "start_character": 22030,
        "end_character": 22247
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We derive the majority of our revenue from licensing audio and video technology to electronics manufacturers, and a lesser portion of our revenue by offering premium audio and video technologies to cinema exhibitors.",
        "start_character": 1389,
        "end_character": 1605
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We generate most of our revenue by licensing technology, our brand, and patents to device manufacturers, and selling cinema hardware and services to movie exhibitors.",
        "start_character": 3219,
        "end_character": 3385
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We generate revenue from Dolby Cinema Products by selling and leasing products to exhibitors, excluding Dolby Cinemas, and offering PCS to exhibitors.",
        "start_character": 22267,
        "end_character": 22417
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "First, we license to semiconductor manufacturers who incorporate our technologies in ICs that they sell to OEMs of consumer entertainment devices.",
        "start_character": 9596,
        "end_character": 9742
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "GAAP, we estimate the number of units each customer sells every quarter and record it as revenue, and then true up that estimate when we get the actual unit sales data, typically one quarter in arrears.",
        "start_character": 10293,
        "end_character": 10495
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, some of our current or potential competitors may be able to offer integrated systems in certain markets for entertainment technologies, including audio and imaging, which could make competing technologies that we develop or acquire obsolete.",
        "start_character": 29068,
        "end_character": 29322
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Looking forward, Dolby intends to continue to actively participate (both in standards bodies and independently) in the development of next-generation standardized audio and video technologies and, in particular, we are exploring the use of artificial intelligence in the development and use of audio and video codecs.",
        "start_character": 14166,
        "end_character": 14483
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also work closely with technology developers to create and promote standardized technologies that enable content to be enjoyed any place, any time on a broad range of devices.",
        "start_character": 2788,
        "end_character": 2966
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a majority stockholder and licensor in Via LA, which we co-own with Philips and Mitsubishi.",
        "start_character": 18632,
        "end_character": 18730
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001308547-25-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001308547-25-000007-b7d5a96dee84d4fc",
        "accession_number": "0001308547-25-000007",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that this growing body of Dolby Atmos and Dolby Vision content provides device manufacturers with an incentive to license our technology in order to make it available to their customers.",
